	Description: "<span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">Carter</span> has invited you to join him in a Park clean up event. It occurs Saturday between 7AM and 11AM at the City Park. While it may not be the most exciting thing ever, you know <span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">Carter</span> would be very happy if you did show up.",
